MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_001: Ah, Loretta! It's nice and early, isn't it? Are you here\nto train too?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_002: You'd better believe it! Gotta shake off the\nmorning z's.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_003: That's the spirit. How about I show you a thing or\ntwo? You ready?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_004: You asked for it, so don't complain if you get it!\nHyah!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_005: What do you call that?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_006: She barely even moved! How did she block my\nsword so easily? And...grab it? Hey, let go!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_007: Heh. That's what you get when your sword work is\nsloppy. Let's go again.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_008: You're something else. You blocked everything I\nthrew at you! I'm not even mad!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_009: They don't call me "Mikaela Redblade" for nothing.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_010: You can say that again! Wait, actually...why do they\ncall you that?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_011: I would expect you could guess. I bloodied my blade\non so many foes... It just stuck.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_012: It's...a little bit much, isn't it?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_013: Much? It's cool! I want a killer nickname!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_014: I guess you're easily impressed. And, I guess you're\njealous too.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_015: Well...I don't even have a nickname. The closest\nthing is what some people at my temple call me.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_016: Crybaby... How annoying! I didn't cry much until\nI got there. Things were hard!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_017: But once I come back to the temple with a killer\nnickname, they'll forget all about it!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_018: Well, you have plenty of gumption. I'm sure you'll\npick up a nickname sooner or later.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_019: You know, I used to cry, too, when I was little. My\nolder sister would always make it better.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_020: Really? You? That's hard to imagine! I mean, looking\nat you now.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_021: Nice of you to say. Thing is, I put my mind to it. I\njust trained as hard as I could, so I'd get stronger.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_022: That's what you have to do! Train hard, move on,\nand forget that anybody ever called you crybaby.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_023: You're right! I'm gonna train day and night! I'll\nshow 'em!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_024: Hold on there! You're young, and there's plenty of\ntime to figure out who you want to be.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_025: Don't worry! I know! Anyway, I gotta go!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_C_026: She's got plenty of energy, and she's a good kid...but\nshe has some growing up to do.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_001: Now THAT was delicious. Nothing beats sand boar\nand beans!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_002: It fills me with energy, keeps me going the whole\nday! I love it!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_003: Look who won the clean-plate award! You're always\nwelcome at Mikaela's kitchen.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_004: My daughter hates this dish—says it gives her\nheartburn. So you've made me one happy cook.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_005: Well, I think it's good! This is the kind of food you\nneed to eat if you want to get strong.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_006: I do hope she's eating healthy. But we all have things\nwe love, and we all have things we hate. 
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_007: Well, keep on making it, and I'll keep on eating it! I\nwant to get as strong as you, after all.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_008: Are you sure you want me for a role model? Live like\nme, and you might end up regretting it.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_009: What do you mean?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_010: Well, take this, for instance. I never tried wearing\nanything cute.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_011: Something cute? Where'd this come from?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_012: Surprised? It's just...when I was young, I didn't\nunderstand why other girls did that.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_013: But now that I'm older, I'm wondering why I didn't\njust give it a try. I could have.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_014: After all, now's the time. For you, I mean. For me...\nmight be a little late.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_015: Now that I'm a bit older, the idea... Mm.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_016: You lost me.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_017: Not surprised. Point is, while you're young, you can\ntry anything you want.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_018: What are you saying? None of this makes any sense!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_019: Why does any of that matter? You're Mikaela\nRedblade! Shrug it off!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_020: Ah!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_021: Didn't you tell me? You used to cry all the time. And\nyou got stronger.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_022: But listen to yourself! You sound like a whiny little\nkid who doesn't know what she wants!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_023: You might be right. This isn't really like me, is it?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_024: Looks like the student has become the teacher. Do as\nI say, not as I do, right?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_025: Hehehe. But if you want to get all dressed up, let's\ndo it...together! You pick out the clothes.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_026: Really? You'd be up for it? Maybe then... Why not?\nJust what I'd expect from Loretta the Dauntless!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_027: Dauntless? What does THAT mean?
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_028: It means you're strong! Brave! Fearless! It means\nyour courage inspires everyone.
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_029: Wait...is that my nickname? That is pretty killer!\nThank you, thaaank you!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_030: Now all I've gotta do is get strong enough to live up\nto it. And live without regrets!
MID_SE_Mic_Lor_B_031: I'll be right there beside you, while you march\nstraight into the future.